WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:02.263
♫ ["Goodbye Yellow Brick Road"
by Elton John] ♫

00:00:02.313 --> 00:00:04.021
SCOTT LANG
I used to ask myself a lot of questions.

00:00:04.523 --> 00:00:08.025
Scott, you're an ex-con...
How are you an Avenger?

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:10.285
That doesn't make sense.

00:00:11.041 --> 00:00:13.847
But everywhere I go,
people tell me the same thing.

00:00:14.706 --> 00:00:16.116
CAFE OWNER
Thank you, Spider-Man!

00:00:18.174 --> 00:00:19.545
CASSIE LANG
People still need help, Dad.

00:00:19.596 --> 00:00:21.280
That's why we made this.

00:00:22.846 --> 00:00:26.627
It's like a satellite for
deep space, but Quantum!

00:00:26.678 --> 00:00:27.742
JANET VAN DYNE
Wait, wait a minute.

00:00:27.792 --> 00:00:30.848
You're sending a signal
down to the Quantum Realm?

00:00:32.479 --> 00:00:34.927
Turn it off, now!

00:00:39.089 --> 00:00:40.632
[Screaming]

00:00:41.475 --> 00:00:42.976
[Screaming]

00:00:44.093 --> 00:00:44.802
CASSIE LANG
Dad?

00:00:44.852 --> 00:00:46.305
SCOTT LANG
Cassie!

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:50.092
♪♪

00:00:57.104 --> 00:00:59.918
CASSIE LANG
Where... are we?

00:00:59.969 --> 00:01:07.868
♫ When are you gonna come down?
When are you going to land? ♫

00:01:07.918 --> 00:01:13.532
♫ I should have stayed on the farm
I should have listened to my old man ♫

00:01:13.583 --> 00:01:15.959
JANET VAN DYNE
It's a secret universe beneath ours.

00:01:18.661 --> 00:01:19.938
HOPE VAN DYNE
What are you so afraid of?

00:01:23.138 --> 00:01:24.927
JANET VAN DYNE
There's something I never told you.

00:01:27.974 --> 00:01:28.939
KANG
This place...

00:01:31.703 --> 00:01:32.943
...it isn't what you think.

00:01:35.833 --> 00:01:43.002
♫ Oh, I've finally decided my future lies
Beyond the yellow brick road ♫

00:01:43.052 --> 00:01:45.636
♪♪

00:01:45.687 --> 00:01:46.999
KANG
I can get you home...

00:01:49.001 --> 00:01:50.978
...and give you more time...

00:01:53.924 --> 00:01:55.007
...if you help me.

00:02:00.463 --> 00:02:03.353
KANG
So, what's it gonna be...

00:02:05.354 --> 00:02:06.593
...Ant-Man?

00:02:06.644 --> 00:02:08.553
♪♪

